    {
      "id": "b-explore-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Where the listings come from",
      "body": [
        "Event listings come from UW-Madison Events and the Wisconsin Union event calendar; Badger Supports programs come from Badger Supports Connect. Bus routes come from Madison Metro's published route data, and addresses are placed with OpenStreetMap. Class listings come from UW Course Search, the university\u2019s official course listings, and the Academic Support Navigator points to resources in this site\u2019s resource library. Nothing you type into a tool here is kept."
